      "text": "[9:03PM] #Sangotedo #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood vehicular movement on Ado Badore Road, both inward and outward, en route to Alesh and Abraham Adesanya.\nSmooth traffic flow from Abraham Adesanya, both inward and outward, on Ogombo Road.\nUnimpeded traffic movement from Lekki Gardens Phase 2, Alasia, LBS, Sangotedo, and Ogidan, before Jonathan Bridge, with a smooth ride to DKK Supermarket.\nGood traffic conditions onward journey from DKK to ShopRite, by Peace Garden Estate turning.\nSmooth traffic flow from ShopRite to Majeek, Abijo, Awoyaya School Gate, Lakowe, Bogije, Frajend, and down to Eleko Junction, with a similarly good return journey.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
