      "text": "[9:45PM] #IyanaOworo #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood traffic movement from Adekunle inward Unilag Waterfront, down to Ilaje, and further inward to Iyana Oworo.\nGood traffic conditions on the return journey from Iyana Oworo to Adekunle.\nTraffic-free movement from Iyana Oworo towards Olopo-Meji, down to Gbagada, and inward Charly Boy, with a similarly smooth return journey from Charly Boy back to Gbagada.\n\nGridlock-free traffic on the entire stretch from Deeper Life down to New Garage and Baale.\nSmooth traffic movement towards Muritala, down to Bariga Roundabout.\nUnimpeded traffic flow towards Ilaje Chemist Bus Stop, down to Pako, Unilag Gate, and Abule Oja.\nSmooth return journey from Unilag Gate back to Baale.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
